(g) compiling a report providing as comprehensive an account of the activities, investigations and recommendations of the Commission, including-

(i) recording of positive experiences of aggrieved persons and the potential to use them towards non-recurrence of alleged damage or harm caused to persons or property or alleged violation of human rights referred to in subsection (1);

(ii) general recommendations on measures to prevent the future occurrence of the alleged damage or harm caused to persons or property, loss of life or alleged violation of human rights referred to in subsection (1), including recommendations on promotion of reconciliation, co-existence among diverse communities, good governance, justice, respect for the rule of law and combating impunity; and

