1.This Act may be cited as the Janaraja Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2023 and this non-governmentorganization which has been established for the purpose ofsocial welfare is called as Janaraja Foundation.

3.The general objects for which the Foundation isconstituted are hereby declared to be—

(a)the achievement of human well-being without anyindifference to race, religion, caste etc.;

