(2) The first Board of Management of the Foundationshall consist of members who held office prior to the date ofoperation of this Act.

(3) The Board of Management shall consist of membersin the following hierarchical order–

(a)The Chairperson;

(b)Three posts of Vice Chairpersons (appointed undervarious subjects);

(c)The Registrar;

(d)Three posts of Assistant Registrars (appointed undervarious subjects);

