(4) General responsibilities of the Board ofManagement–

(a)The Chairperson–

(i)He shall be responsible for all the affairswith his leadership;

(ii)He shall preside at every meeting of theBoard;

(iii)He shall build up well-being and thecoordination of the Board of Management;

(iv)He shall re-structure all the necessities;

(v)He shall provide the necessary plans torequest and collect contributions, grants,donations and all forms of gifts that arenecessary for the purposes of theFoundation.

(b)The Vice Chairpersons–

(i)In the absence of Chairperson, they shallperform the duties of the Chairperson inaccordance with his order;

(ii)They shall organize and maintain theprojects assigned and conferred to them.

